# Narrow build context; test keys and local outputs must never enter the image.
**
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!.npmrc
!tsconfig*.json
!artifacts/
!artifacts/api-server/
!artifacts/api-server/**
!lib/
!lib/**
!sites/
!sites/poc/
!sites/poc/Dockerfile
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env*
**/.git
**/.poc
**/*.tsbuildinfo
